    },
    {
      "id": "b5ba67b4cdb30f3c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 2000,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "# Hassabis and DeepMind — academic roots to research teams\n\nA historical view. Orange B edges are book reports pending independent checking; official sources anchor the central genealogy.\n\n[[00 Start Here|Guide]] · [[01 Map Index|All maps]] · [[03 Evidence and Open Questions|Evidence rules]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "7d112a21d54203fa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** blue · **◆ INSTITUTION** purple · **■ COMPANY** amber · **▣ LAB / TEAM** green · **◇ CONTEXT** grey\n\n**V** green edges = primary-source checked. **B** amber edges = book report. Full evidence and dates are in the linked notes. Grouping is navigation, not a current org chart."
    },
    {
      "id": "3d48a961dc8b99b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**◆ INSTITUTION** · book + web\n\n### [[Institutions/University of Cambridge|University of Cambridge]]\n\nUniversity.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cam.ac.uk/)",
      "color": "#B19CDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "430c80e12d5f4348",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**◆ INSTITUTION** · web extension\n\n### [[Institutions/Queens' College, Cambridge|Queens' College, Cambridge]]\n\nCambridge constituent college; distinct from the university.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.queens.cam.ac.uk/)",
      "color": "#B19CDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "332f178f730bcdd0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/John Daugman|John Daugman]]\n\nCambridge professor who tutored Hassabis and Silver as undergraduates\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=100|PDF p. 100]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b251740987a13d3f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Peter Molyneux|Peter Molyneux]]\n\nBullfrog founder; Hassabis employer, mentor and Elixir investor\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=86|PDF p. 86]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "584b5c97a448c4f6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/Bullfrog Productions|Bullfrog Productions]]\n\nGames studio employing Hassabis.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ae-info.org/ae/Member/Hassabis_Demis/CV)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "5255910d8326e10b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/Elixir Studios|Elixir Studios]]\n\nGames studio founded and led by Hassabis 1998–2005.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ae-info.org/ae/Member/Hassabis_Demis/CV)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "76e0cf93eedbe987",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/Lionhead Studios|Lionhead Studios]]\n\nGames studio where Hassabis was a founding team member.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ae-info.org/ae/Member/Hassabis_Demis/CV)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8d692e5b18eae6c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Eleanor Maguire|Eleanor Maguire]]\n\nUCL cognitive neuroscientist and Hassabis's primary PhD supervisor; died 2025.\n\n[Profile / source](https://royalsociety.org/people/eleanor-maguire-12883/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "34b3c2ea175a9473",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Geraint Rees|Geraint Rees]]\n\nHassabis's secondary PhD supervisor.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ucl.ac.uk/brain-sciences/news/2024/oct/ucl-alumnus-and-ai-innovator-awarded-nobel-prize-chemistry)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b01ec1350b49c86a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**◆ INSTITUTION** · book + web\n\n### [[Institutions/University College London|University College London]]\n\nUniversity; abbreviated UCL.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ucl.ac.uk/)",
      "color": "#B19CDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "68e93d017a74251e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Tomaso Poggio|Tomaso Poggio]]\n\nMIT computational neuroscientist and Hassabis postdoctoral mentor\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=124|PDF p. 124]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "aae76ba8b4ae2590",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**◆ INSTITUTION** · book\n\n### [[Institutions/Massachusetts Institute of Technology|Massachusetts Institute of Technology]]\n\nHassabis postdoctoral institution; Poggio, Minsky and Winston affiliations\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=41|PDF p. 41]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#B19CDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a621def2ca54f71",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**◆ INSTITUTION** · book\n\n### [[Institutions/Harvard University|Harvard University]]\n\nPutnam affiliation; Hassabis postdoctoral appointment\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=100|PDF p. 100]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#B19CDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2e5bd704a620002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Peter Dayan|Peter Dayan]]\n\nComputational neuroscientist; former Gatsby director.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.kyb.tuebingen.mpg.de/person/95844)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "4453c495ccf66aae",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**▣ LAB** · book + web\n\n### [[Labs/Gatsby Computational Neuroscience Unit|Gatsby Computational Neuroscience Unit]]\n\nUCL academic research unit; established 1998.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ucl.ac.uk/life-sciences/gatsby/about)",
      "color": "#63BFA7"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a0399dfb1a34b7b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Demis Hassabis|Demis Hassabis]]\n\nDeepMind co-founder; cognitive-neuroscience PhD.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.ae-info.org/ae/Member/Hassabis_Demis/CV)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "6613dfdef5b6061c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3010,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Shane Legg|Shane Legg]]\n\nDeepMind co-founder; doctorate supervised by Marcus Hutter.\n\n[Profile / source](https://susi.usi.ch/usi/documents/317954)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "90120a286759cf3a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Mustafa Suleyman|Mustafa Suleyman]]\n\nDeepMind and Inflection AI co-founder; appointed Microsoft AI CEO in 2024.\n\n[Profile / source](https://mustafa-suleyman.ai/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d1941bb3aeea58a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3010,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Marcus Hutter|Marcus Hutter]]\n\nIDSIA researcher; Legg PhD adviser and intelligence-definition collaborator\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=131|PDF p. 131]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d901efffa316987",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Jürgen Schmidhuber|Jürgen Schmidhuber]]\n\nResearcher combining deep and reinforcement learning.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=473|PDF p. 473]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "12e815b303ccbf7d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3010,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**◆ INSTITUTION** · web extension\n\n### [[Institutions/Università della Svizzera italiana|Università della Svizzera italiana]]\n\nUniversity, also known as USI or University of Lugano.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.usi.ch/en)",
      "color": "#B19CDE"
    },
    {
      "id": "4750d69f89d99ce7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**■ COMPANY** · book + web\n\n### [[Companies/DeepMind|DeepMind]]\n\nCompany founded 2010; acquired by Google 2014; historical entity distinguished from 2023 Google DeepMind.\n\n[Profile / source](https://deepmind.google/blog/from-unlikely-start-up-to-major-scientific-organisation-entering-our-tenth-year-at-deepmind/)",
      "color": "#E8AD59"
    },
    {
      "id": "87f638677054574a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3010,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**▣ LAB** · book + web\n\n### [[Labs/Google DeepMind|Google DeepMind]]\n\nGoogle unit created in 2023 by combining DeepMind and Google Brain.\n\n[Profile / source](https://deepmind.google/about/)",
      "color": "#63BFA7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0b1bc35583839e9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3900,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/David Silver|David Silver]]\n\nReinforcement-learning researcher; former DeepMind team leader.\n\n[Profile / source](https://davidstarsilver.wordpress.com/about/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "8896f984849cb9d9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4310,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Dharshan Kumaran|Dharshan Kumaran]]\n\nHassabis chess friend and neuroscience research collaborator at UCL\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=82|PDF p. 82]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "3abdeee2231071a5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3900,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Volodymyr Mnih|Volodymyr Mnih]]\n\nHinton PhD alumnus; DQN researcher. Distinct from brother Andriy Mnih.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.cs.utoronto.ca/~vmnih/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "8d137ffb33b786d6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4310,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Koray Kavukcuoglu|Koray Kavukcuoglu]]\n\nLeCun PhD alumnus; DeepMind research leader.\n\n[Profile / source](https://yann.lecun.com/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "33a885e945268322",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3900,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/Arthur Guez|Arthur Guez]]\n\nUCL PhD supervised jointly by Dayan and Silver.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.gatsby.ucl.ac.uk/~aguez/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e38a5beed59481b4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4310,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Aja Huang|Aja Huang]]\n\nComputer Go researcher recruited to DeepMind by Silver.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=218|PDF p. 218]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "7afca86c58b86cf9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3900,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book + web\n\n### [[People/John Jumper|John Jumper]]\n\nAlphaFold researcher; 2024 Nobel laureate.\n\n[Profile / source](https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/chemistry/2024/jumper/facts/)",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "087cd5ecd681cbaf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4310,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Andrew Senior|Andrew Senior]]\n\nDeepMind protein-folding team leader.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=331|PDF p. 331]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fd242ec2ab37aa3e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3900,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Oriol Vinyals|Oriol Vinyals]]\n\nGoogle sequence-to-sequence researcher who joined DeepMind in 2016.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=274|PDF p. 274]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    },
    {
      "id": "50f23879c8e61bf3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4310,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "**● HUMAN** · book\n\n### [[People/Jack Rae|Jack Rae]]\n\nDeepMind researcher advocating large language-model research.\n\n[[Sources/Hassabis - source book.pdf#page=289|PDF p. 289]] · profile pending",
      "color": "#43A8D1"
    }
  ],
